---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, experience, education, skillGroups, focus } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="关于"
  description="榕（RickRone），前端工程师，3 年经验，专注工程化与 AI 应用。"
>
  <article class="about wrap">
    <header class="about-head">
      <h1>关于</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">榕 · 前端工程师 · 3 年经验</p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-intro">
      <p>
        我是榕（RickRone），安徽人。3 年前端开发经验，现在在一家企业软件服务商做中后台与前端基建。
      </p>
      <p>
        我的工作大致分三块：把业务系统做稳（中后台、数据可视化、工作流），把重复的事工程化（Monorepo、组件库、CI/CD），把 AI 真正用进研发流程（大模型接入、AI 应用前端）。
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>工作经历</h2>
      <ol class="timeline">
        {experience.map((job, index) => (
          <li class="stint">
            <p class="stint-time">
              {job.period}
              {index === 0 && <span class="badge">最近一段</span>}
            </p>
            <h3>{job.company}</h3>
            <p class="stint-role">{job.role}</p>
            <ul>
              {job.points.map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>教育</h2>
      <p class="edu-line">{education.school} · {education.major} · {education.period}</p>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        {education.honors.map((honor) => <li>{honor}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>技术栈</h2>
      <div class="skill-grid">
        {skillGroups.map((group) => (
          <section class="skill-group">
            <h3>{group.group}</h3>
            <p class="skill-note">{group.note}</p>
            <ul>
              {group.items.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </section>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>关注方向</h2>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        {focus.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>联系</h2>
      <p class="contact-line">
        邮件：<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
        GitHub：<a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem);
  }

  .about-head {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-head h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .about-lead {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .about-intro {
    max-width: 64ch;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .about-intro p + p {
    margin-top: 1em;
  }

  .block {
    margin-top: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .block h2 {
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Timeline */
  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
    padding: 0 0 0 1.75rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .stint {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .stint:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .stint::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.62em;
    left: calc(-1.75rem - 3.5px);
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .stint-time {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .badge {
    padding: 0.02em 0.4em;
    border: 1px solid var(--seal);
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--seal);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .stint h3 {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .stint-role {
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .stint ul {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .stint li + li,
  .plain-list li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35em;
  }

  .edu-line {
    margin-top: 1.3rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .plain-list {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  /* Skills */
  .skill-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem 3rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  .skill-group h3 {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .skill-note {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .skill-group ul {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .skill-group li {
    padding: 0.45rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .contact-line {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .contact-line a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .contact-line a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .skill-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
